    <scripts />
    <show_scrollbar>false</show_scrollbar>
    <text>Tank_avg_press is a derived parameter computed by the MDB algorithm TANK_Pressure_Avg from H2TankPressure and O2TankPressure.

Its alarm definition raises a WARNING below 8 bar or above 35 bar, so it trips each time the tanks run dry and clears when they are refilled. The value border turns orange when that happens.</text>
